  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'prospective without white' located at the bottom center of the image. The text acts as the focal point for the user's interpretation, as it carries the conceptual and potentially harmful message that is being overlaid on the visual scene. The user is not explicitly projected onto the visual material (the person browsing) or the scene itself, but rather onto the textual material which defines the meme's intent and meaning.",
